<title>USA: Photronics to be added to SmallCap 600.</title>
<headline>Photronics to be added to SmallCap 600.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said it would replace TPI Enterprises Inc in the S&amp;P SmallCap 600 Index with Photronics Inc after the close of trading on Monday, Sept. 9.</p>
<p>Shoney's Inc, a S&amp;P 500 Index component, is acquiring the TPI Restaurants subsidiary of TPI Enterprises in a stock transaction scheduled to close on that date.</p>
<p>Photronics makes ultra-high-precision photomasks, which contain microscopic images of electronic circuits and are used in the fabrication of integrated circuits and other electronic components.</p>
</text>
